  "note": "Election of the Coleraine Borough Council, 21 May 1958: four aldermen and twelve councillors returned unopposed after one withdrawal (Belfast News-Letter, 8 and 9 May 1958). The report says three retiring aldermen and Mr. S. J. Walker were returned unopposed as aldermen; Alderman G. W. Wilson did not seek re-election. No party label was printed. Returned unopposed."
